OL,3,GNEWSAWarning to drivers as part of M60
OL,4,Ato shut again
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of "severe
OL,7,Fcongestion" when a busy stretch of
OL,8,Fmotorway is closed this weekend as part
OL,9,Fof an upgrade to the road.
OL,11,FJunction 17 and 18 of the M60 in Bury,
OL,12,FGreater Manchester, will be shut on
OL,13,FSaturday evening until 06:00 on Monday.
OL,15,FThe closures are to enable the
OL,16,Fdemolition of two large overhead
OL,17,Fgantries at the Simister Island
OL,18,FInterchange. It comes after two others
OL,19,Fwere removed last month.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
